    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b26aefdaade370bd3362d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光的气势与热情十分惊人，\n就仿佛刚跑完一场比赛那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1771ec22a2e4bc17139427515942162fd8538840bfbd7d16320a39f3cb98a077",
